Attribution
================================================================================

The executable layer of this project (src/harness/ and .claude/skills/)
reimplements STRUCTURAL IDEAS from public agent-engineering projects, research
papers, and open standards. No upstream code or prose was copied, vendored, or
forked, and this project takes no runtime dependency on any of them. Where a
source is the canonical origin of a NAME (e.g. an OpenTelemetry attribute key),
only the name is reused, as a string constant for interoperability.

Ideas reimplemented, with attribution (full mapping in sources/credits.md):

