The pure-pattern skills verification-loop, tdd-workflow and prompt-optimizer encode general
software and prompt-engineering practice (no specific upstream source).

Anthropic concepts (proprietary docs) are referenced by NAME ONLY -- the
"Building Effective Agents" workflow shape names (prompt-chaining, routing,
parallelization, orchestrator-workers, evaluator-optimizer) and the Agent Skills
SKILL.md frontmatter conventions. No Anthropic prose or code was reproduced.

License tags above are stated as of this writing; verify at the source before
relying on them. They describe the upstream projects, not this project.
